<title>INDONESIA: Gudang Garam H1 net soars.</title>
<headline>Gudang Garam H1 net soars.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			277.59 vs 152.14</p>
<p>    Net sales		     3,025.04 vs 2,576.79</p>
<p>    Operating profit		458.49 vs 298.60</p>
<p>    Expenses			   53.15 vs 80.88</p>
<p>Note: PT Gudang Garam is a cigarette maker.</p>
</text>
